  "description": "You’ve arrived at the scene of a crime… but you’re not a detective.\nYou’re an evidence cleaner.\n\nYour job is to find and remove the clues the culprit left behind, and help turn each case into the perfect crime.\n\nHow to play is simple:\n\nRead the case description\nPick the matching piece of evidence from the illustration\nGet it right, and the evidence disappears from the scene\n\nEach client has their own dark story:\n\nA groom who took the bride’s life in a wedding waiting room\nA stalker who murdered an idol in a TV studio dressing room\nAn arsonist who was burned to death by the fire they started\n\n…and more.\n\nCollect every incriminating trace the culprit accidentally left behind, and send each case into the unsolved files!",
